:Process_04
    a :ProcessingRoute ;
    rdfs:label "Processing Route – Study 04"^^xsd:string ;
    :absorberPrimaryDepositionMethod "MOCVD"^^xsd:string ;
    :sequentialProcessingSteps "(1) MOCVD growth of the device structure with an Al0.52In0.48P light scattering layer on a GaAs substrate, (2) fabrication of Ni/Ge/Au/Ti/Au point contacts on the back surface via photolithography and e-beam deposition, (3) annealing using rapid thermal annealing to form ohmic contacts, (4) deposition of Au and Cr mirror layers, (5) flip-chip bonding to a Si carrier substrate using melted indium, (6) removal of GaAs substrate via chemical etching, (7) deposition of Ti/Pt/Au top contact grids, (8) removal of GaAs contact layer to expose window layer, (9) mesa isolation via chemical etching, (10) deposition of MgF2/ZnS antireflection coating"^^xsd:string .
 
