# ============================================================
# Named Individuals – Row 5  (DOI: 10.1016/j.solmat.2022.111930)
# ============================================================
 
:Study_05
    a :Publication ;
    rdfs:label "Study 05 – Flexible fabric-based GaAs thin-film cell via ELO"^^xsd:string ;
    :doi <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.solmat.2022.111930> ;
    :keyTakeaways "A flexible fabric-based GaAs thin-film solar cell was successfully fabricated using a stress-assisted fast epitaxial lift-off technique. The transfer process utilized a designed sacrificial layer, an Au-Au bonding method, and a polyimide support layer to preserve epitaxial quality on a rough fabric carrier. The resulting device achieved a power conversion efficiency of 17.49% and maintained stable performance over 1000 bending cycles, highlighting its potential for wearable energy harvesting."^^xsd:string ;
    :numberOfFigures 6 ;
    :descriptiveListOfFigures "(1) schematic diagram and TEM image of thin-film GaAs epi layer on fabric carrier, (2) schematic diagram and cross-sectional SEM images of the fabricated fabric-based GaAs PV cell, (3) J-V curve and PV parameters of the thin-film GaAs PV cell along with power conversion efficiency comparison, (4) EQE and reflectance of the thin-film GaAs PV cell on fabric carrier, (5) photovoltaic characteristic variation depending on bending curvature and cycle, (6) photograph of fabricated thin-film GaAs PV cell on fabric carrier"^^xsd:string ;
    :numberOfEquations 0 ;
    :numberOfTables 0 .
 
:Absorber_05
    a :AbsorberLayer ;
    rdfs:label "Absorber Layer – Study 05"^^xsd:string ;
    :absorberMaterialComposition "GaAs"^^xsd:string ;
    :absorberCrystallinity "single crystal"^^xsd:string ;
    :absorberBandgapType "direct"^^xsd:string ;
    :absorberDopantPolarity "p-type"^^xsd:string ;
    :absorberBulkResistivity "not specified"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasDopant :Dopant_05 .
 
:Dopant_05
    a :Dopant ;
    rdfs:label "Dopant – Study 05 (Si, Zn)"^^xsd:string ;
    :dopantSpecies "Si, Zn"^^xsd:string .
 
:Process_05
    a :ProcessingRoute ;
    rdfs:label "Processing Route – Study 05"^^xsd:string ;
    :absorberPrimaryDepositionMethod "metalorganic chemical vapour deposition"^^xsd:string ;
    :sequentialProcessingSteps "(1) MOCVD growth of inverted GaAs PV structures with sacrificial layers on a GaAs substrate, (2) deposition of back metals on the GaAs epi-layer and fabric substrate, (3) mechanical bonding via an Au-Au bonding process under uniform pressure and heating, (4) attachment of a polyimide layer underneath the fabric carrier, (5) epitaxial lift-off separation of the inverted PV epilayer by etching the AlAs sacrificial layer in a HF/acetone solution, (6) selective etching of buffer and protective layers, (7) photolithography and front metal deposition, (8) deposition of MgF2/ZnS double-layers for anti-reflection coating"^^xsd:string .
 
